#: src/settings.php:152
msgid "With a key saved, the title and text of each published post are sent to OpenAI to be turned into vectors, which Undergrowth uses to suggest links between your posts. Nothing is sent until you save a key. Undergrowth never writes or changes your posts."
msgstr ""

