#: src/settings.php:195
msgid "Anthropic API key"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php:201
msgid "With a key saved, Undergrowth asks Claude, through the Anthropic API, to write you an occasional question about your own writing. Each request sends one post’s title, a few sentences quoted from that post and, when the question comes from a reader’s comment, the text of that comment. Whole posts are never sent. Nothing is sent until you save a key. The questions appear only on your Dashboard, never to your readers."
msgstr ""

